# Prop Betting Model Calculator

A Streamlit app that pulls live DraftKings player prop lines, OCRs prop
screenshots, runs them through a custom trigger system, and backtests
whether those triggers actually beat a coin flip.

## Setup

1. Clone this repo and `cd` into it.
2. Install dependencies:
```bash
   pip install -r requirements.txt
```
3. Copy the secrets template and add your real API key:
```bash
   cp .streamlit/secrets.toml.example .streamlit/secrets.toml
```
   Then open `.streamlit/secrets.toml` and paste your key from
   [the-odds-api.com](https://the-odds-api.com) in place of the placeholder.
4. Run the app:
```bash
   streamlit run prop_calculator.py
```

`.streamlit/secrets.toml` is gitignored and will never be committed.
